# The release image needs only the manifest, locked dependency graph, build
# script, scanner source, embedded rules, and redistributed license notices.
# A whitelist prevents local secrets, Git metadata, caches, and editor/agent
# state from being transmitted to a local or remote Docker builder.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!src/
!src/**
!rules/
!rules/**
!LICENSE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
